{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axe Ghost</strong> is an unforgiving turn-based spatial battle against an advancing monster horde. You play cards to manipulate enemies. Group them up and wipe them out to climb the daily leaderboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/d194ed1d67870f7067dc5f1588957ab6.poster.avif?t=1757929483\" width=616 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/d194ed1d67870f7067dc5f1588957ab6.webm?t=1757929483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lasts around 20 minutes. The weapons dealt let you push, swap, clone, slice, freeze, magnetize and destroy the advancing monsters before they reach the bottom of the grid. Group them cleverly - the more monsters you destroy in a single attack, the more each one is worth. Accept optional constraints in the form of <strong>Quests</strong> to multiply your score. Spend <strong>Coins</strong> to play extra cards in critical moments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/a992cc183814c5655062380bf588ecc8.poster.avif?t=1757929483\" width=616 height=253 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/a992cc183814c5655062380bf588ecc8.webm?t=1757929483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lord Garnemar</strong>, the loathsome boss, is only vulnerable when surrounded on four sides by the same type of monster. Defeat him before deadly robots overrun the battlefield and the timer runs out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/3ef3feb51aff13c3b11229f9bdffafc5.poster.avif?t=1757929483\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/3ef3feb51aff13c3b11229f9bdffafc5.webm?t=1757929483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/3ef3feb51aff13c3b11229f9bdffafc5.mp4?t=1757929483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragments</strong> is a collection of 21 hand\u2011crafted puzzles by Richard Boeser (ibb &amp; obb, Dubio). With a single hand of cards you must rearrange the monsters to achieve the objective. Fragments can be completed in any order. They begin gently, the hardest ones are tough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/d954a8232f11ac59f06d343d3655d17d.poster.avif?t=1757929483\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/d954a8232f11ac59f06d343d3655d17d.webm?t=1757929483\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2712670/extras/d954a8232f11ac59f06d343d3655d17d.mp4?t=1757929483\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I hear them approaching.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ghost Lord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2712670/deed45aad766f3ee2fac6e56c02c6d653a6a75ff.jpg"},{"name":"Veteran","path":"https://cdn